{
  "id": "MailClassifyAI01",
  "name": "Mail – 2. Classification IA (Groq)",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "353e5705-adfa-5354-b35b-fb035d00bd02",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Classification par IA\n- Récupère les e-mails **en attente** (contenu déjà masqué : téléphones, IBAN).\n- **Un appel à la fois** + pause de 2 s entre deux appels.\n- Erreur HTTP (dont **429 quota**) : 3 essais espacés de 5 s, puis pause de 60 s et reprise sur l'e-mail suivant ; l'e-mail reste en attente et sera repris au prochain passage.\n- Le **backend valide** la sortie JSON : `ok`, `retry` (une seule nouvelle tentative) ou `fallback` (« autre » + à vérifier).\n\nClé : variable d'environnement `GROQ_API_KEY` (jamais stockée dans le workflow).",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "73a84914-6d2a-53f4-8f86-ec0b54b06855",
      "name": "Toutes les 2 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -260,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9891baee-f56e-548a-a4e6-d815771f3d11",
      "name": "Clé IA configurée ?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ !!$env.GROQ_API_KEY }}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ec674072-b605-54d0-ad54-3c2aecd3ce61",
      "name": "Backend : e-mails à classer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.BACKEND_URL }}/api/webhooks/n8n/classification/pending?limit=10",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Webhook-Secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.WEBHOOK_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "25a9a193-a476-516a-b7da-9030d447d190",
      "name": "Au moins un e-mail ?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ !!$json.id }}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6339022f-42d6-550a-a2a4-24a8145d6084",
      "name": "Loop Over Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        620,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "712caa8b-ecfa-52da-a03a-a916bfd8892c",
      "name": "Groq : classer (essai 1)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        860,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/chat/completions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.GROQ_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "raw",
        "rawContentType": "application/json",
        "body": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: $env.GROQ_MODEL || 'qwen/qwen3.8-27b', temperature: 0.2, response_format: { type: 'json_object' }, max_tokens: 300, messages: [{ role: 'system', content: \"Tu classes des e-mails professionnels reçus par une petite entreprise française. Réponds UNIQUEMENT avec un objet JSON valide, sans aucun texte autour, exactement de la forme {\\\"category\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"priority\\\": 1, \\\"summary\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"...\\\"}. category : une valeur parmi \\\"client\\\", \\\"facture\\\", \\\"rendez-vous\\\", \\\"newsletter\\\", \\\"spam probable\\\", \\\"autre\\\". priority : entier 1 (urgent), 2 (normal) ou 3 (faible). summary : une seule phrase en français résumant l'e-mail. action : l'action attendue de l'utilisateur, en quelques mots.\" }, { role: 'user', content: 'Expéditeur : ' + $json.from_email + '\\nObjet : ' + $json.subject + '\\n\\n' + $json.text }] }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "2956686b-1df0-5c47-9260-79d1579890d5",
      "name": "Signer : essai 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const crypto = require('crypto');\nconst sign = (payload) => 'sha256=' + crypto.createHmac('sha256', $env.WEBHOOK_SECRET).update(payload).digest('hex');\nconst email = $('Loop Over Items').item.json;\nconst raw = ($json.choices && $json.choices[0] && $json.choices[0].message && $json.choices[0].message.content) || '';\nconst payload = JSON.stringify({ email_id: email.id, raw_output: raw, attempt: 1 });\nreturn { json: { payload, signature: sign(payload) } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7dc0614b-fdb0-5507-8253-8ab57afc9a48",
      "name": "Backend : valider essai 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1300,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.BACKEND_URL }}/api/webhooks/n8n/classification",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Webhook-Secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.WEBHOOK_SECRET }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Signature",
              "value": "={{ $json.signature }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "raw",
        "rawContentType": "application/json",
        "body": "={{ $json.payload }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "15551532-a5cc-5ec3-aa4f-788783f59d24",
      "name": "Nouvelle tentative demandée ?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
